        1   DEFINE BUFFER X_c-dis-card-mask FOR ub.c-dis-card-mask.
        2   DEFINE BUFFER X_clients_emitent FOR ub.clients.
        3   DEFINE BUFFER X_clients_sysconf FOR ub.clients.
