     3111     RUN MyEnable in this-procedure .
     3112     RUn OpenBR in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input no).
     3113     HIDE mark-num in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3114     if v-doc-rec <> ? then
     3115     REPOSITION br-masks to recid v-doc-rec No-ERROR.
     3116     run diasize_add_browse in this-procedure
     3117       (input  'width':u
     3118       ,input  browse br-changes :handle
     3119       ) .
     3120     run diasize_init in this-procedure .
