     3123   RUN disable_UI.
     3124   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     3125     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3126   END PROCEDURE.
     3127   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     3128     DISPLAY mark-num
     3129         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3130     ENABLE b-quit B-mark B-sel B-lookup B-sch B-Help BR-masks BR-changes mark-num
     3131         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
